# 19. Troubleshooting Methodology

The general Help Desk troubleshooting process practiced today:

```text
1. Gather information
2. Identify symptoms
3. Ask targeted questions
4. Identify possible causes
5. Start with basic troubleshooting
6. Apply an authorized fix
7. Verify the result
8. Document the resolution
9. Close or escalate
```

This methodology can be applied to Windows, Linux, networking, Active Directory, and Microsoft 365 issues.

